{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23252","headline":"腊後岁前遇景咏意 · 白居易","name":"腊後岁前遇景咏意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海梅半日柳微黄，冻水初融日欲长。\n度腊都无苦霜霰，迎春先有好风光。\n郡中起晚听衙鼓，城上行慵倚女墙。\n公事渐闲身且健，使君殊未厌余杭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}